abstract: "Fixed construction parameters, explicit sparse CSS check matrices, logical witnesses, and reconstruction checks for fourteen APM–PP and CPM–PP instances, including five unchanged-default-rule CPM examples and both outcomes of a shorter-length test. The public minimal-twist seed is attributed to Koki Okada. Lower-bound audits are summarized; complete native search archives are not bundled."
